sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant Q as Coordinator
    participant S as Shards (x100)
    participant L as LLM rerank
    C->>Q: search query, k=20
    Q->>Q: parse, plan, reject pathological shapes
    Q->>S: scatter with an absolute deadline
    Note over Q,S: hedge to a second replica past the shard p95
    S-->>Q: per-shard top-k with globally comparable scores
    Q->>Q: at the deadline, merge whatever arrived
    alt budget remains
        Q->>L: top-50 candidates
        L-->>Q: reordered top-k
    else LLM tier saturated
        Note over Q,L: shed, not queue — keyword ranking stands on its own
    end
    Q-->>C: hits, cursor, index version, partial flag
